#==[31000]-装备 Equipment - 特殊 Special - 势力装备 Influenced==

#==[31001]- Influenced -T0: 顶级势力装备 势力装备 - Class Condition==
Show
    Class == "Body Armours" "Boots" "Gloves" "Helmets" "Shields" "Quivers" "Amulets" "Belts" "Rings" "Bows" "Claws" "Daggers" "Rune Daggers" "Sceptres" "Staves" "Warstaves" "Wands" "One Hand Axes" "One Hand Maces" "One Hand Swords" "Thrusting One Hand Swords" "Two Hand Axes" "Two Hand Maces" "Two Hand Swords"
    HasInfluence Shaper Elder Crusader Hunter Redeemer Warlord
    Rarity <= Rare
    ItemLevel >= 86
    SetFontSize 45
    SetBorderColor 150 0 255 255
    SetBackgroundColor 19 12 23 255
    CustomAlertSound "Sharket掉落音效\顶级底材.mp3" 200
    PlayEffect White
    MinimapIcon 0 White Star


#==[31002]- Influenced -T1: 势力装备 势力装备 - Class Condition==
