#==[32000]-装备 Equipment - 优先精品底材 Crafting Priority==

#==[32001]- Crafting Priority -完美防御数值 优先精品底材 - 自动音效：药剂师手套 - 精确==
Show
    BaseType == "Apothecary's Gloves"
    Rarity <= Rare
    BaseDefencePercentile >= 99
    Corrupted False
    Mirrored False
    ItemLevel >= 84
    SetFontSize 45
    SetTextColor 111 88 42 255
    SetBorderColor 146 123 79 255
    SetBackgroundColor 248 248 242 255
    CustomAlertSound "Sharket掉落音效\药剂师手套.mp3" 200
    PlayEffect White
    MinimapIcon 0 White Star


